# Secrets — never commit. Tokens live in ~/.cache/huggingface/token
# (managed by `hf auth login`) or in a shell-sourced .env file that
# stays OUTSIDE the repo. If you create a local .env for convenience,
# the patterns below keep it untracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
*.secret
hf_*.txt
**/token
**/token.json
